    [
     1,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>To remove loci with all NA’s by populations you can use:</div><div><br></div><div>&gt; test &lt;- gl.filter.allna(<a href=\"http://platypus.gl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://platypus.gl&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792458679437000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Ff2fQgrb1WVATRj71gQV8\">platypus.gl</a>, by.pop = TRUE)</div><div><br></div><div>Cheers,</div><div>Luis<br><div><br><blockquote type=\"cite\"></blockquote></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
